Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:32.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快出发了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna go soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 宝贝 希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, baby. I sure hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.69,0:00:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.49,0:00:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 卡尔 大家都很饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Carl. We all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.49,0:00:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿些吃的给他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I get him something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德对生存技能很有研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed's into all this survival stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.84,0:00:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的速食食品都够养活一个小型军队了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got enough m.R.E.S to feed a small army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那谢谢了 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd sure appreciate it. - No trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛要告诉她这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the hell did you tell her that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本就不认识这群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know these damn people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小男孩饿了 我们可以拿出一盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That boy is hungry. We can spare one box.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.55,0:01:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫做 秘密行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called operational security.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.45,0:01:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈要是再这么乱发善心\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think this stuff is gonna last.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西很快就得被吃完\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you keep running your damn mouth off to everybody we meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.51,0:01:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我没多想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I wasn't thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.89,0:01:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You getting anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么也没有 - 一点也不稀奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's nothing. - Big surprise there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说 什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.60,0:01:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急广播系统停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency broadcast system stopped,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有播报难民安置中心消息的录音\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that recording about the refugee center.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我往前走走 看能发现什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go up the road, see what I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德肯定是忘了把那些速食装包了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed must have forgot to pack those m.R.E.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在我包里找到了这个 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I found these in my purse. - It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.69,0:01:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你能帮我照看一会儿卡尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, do you mind keeping an eye on carl for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和肖恩要去前面打探一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane and I are gonna go scout up ahead a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能找到了解情况的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see if we can find someone that knows what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.07,0:02:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想和你们一起去 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want to come with you. - Huh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们很快就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we'll be back before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 小男子汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, little man, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么不播难民安置中心的消息了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they stop broadcasting about the refugee center?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.54,0:02:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也不知道 - 你觉得他们不再收人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - Think they're turning people away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.51,0:02:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真这样的话 肯定会引发动乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna have a riot on their hands if they try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你爸爸真好 - 肖恩不是我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your dad's nice. - Shane's not my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.61,0:02:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.61,0:02:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么办 - 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do we do? - Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要做瑞克会希望我们做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna do what rick would have wanted us to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.95,0:02:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你和卡尔离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get you and carl out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧我 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay with me now. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.79,0:03:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在往街道上投汽油弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dropping napalm in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.27,0:03:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.37,0:04:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早啊 - 早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我居然睡过头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I slept in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是太困的缘故\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次要叫醒我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time wake me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是洗衣日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially on laundry day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个想法 想听听你的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had an idea I wanted to run by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.68,0:05:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么想法 - 他们家那个大厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - That big kitchen of theirs got me thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺想再在一个真正的厨房里做顿饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't mind cooking in a real kitchen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.69,0:05:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许咱俩都能加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we all pitch in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚一起给赫谢尔和他的家人做顿晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cook dinner for hershel and his family tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是找点事做 不让自己的脑袋闲着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of looking for things to keep my mind occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为我们付出了这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything they've done for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最起码也要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like the least we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意我多邀请几个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind extending the invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得经过你的同意比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would just feel more right coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.03,0:05:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是瑞克的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Rick's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这或多或少让你成了我们的「第一夫人」吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sort of makes you our unofficial first lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家早上好 我们开始行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, guys. Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找的地方有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a lot of ground to cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 今天每个人都有新的搜寻区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everyone's getting new search grids today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:05:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她能跑到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.49,0:05:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔发现的那个农舍那么远的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}as far as the farmhouse daryl found,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.81,0:06:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她去了更往东点的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}She might have gone further east than we've been so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这片地方非常熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the area pretty well and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel's okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.37,0:06:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 同意了 他说我该问问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah yeah. He said I should ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right then. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得达里尔的发现和索菲亚有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing about what Daryl found screams Sophia to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都可能躲在那个农舍里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone could have been holed up in that farmhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也包括她 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody includes her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡在那个橱柜里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever slept in that cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,身高只有这么点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}was no bigger than yay-high.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是条好线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该再沿着她的足迹找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we'll pick up her trail again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别也许了 我要借匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}No maybe about it. I'm gonna borrow a horse,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.61,0:06:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那边的山脊去\N{\fnArial\fs30}head up to this ridge right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.93,0:06:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,往这片地俯瞰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}take a bird's-eye view of the whole grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她在那的话 我肯定能看到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's up there, I'll spot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.05,0:06:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准你还能看到个吸血怪兽呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'll see your chupacabra up there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吸血怪兽 - 你没听说过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chupacabra? - You never heard this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们住营地的第一天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our first night in camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔说这让他想起有次去猎松鼠时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl tells us that the whole thing reminds him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.95,0:06:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了只吸血怪兽的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a time when he went squirrel hunting and he saw a chupacabra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,想怎么着 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you braying at, jackass?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 你相信这世上有吸血狗存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you believe in a blood-sucking dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信死人能行走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe dead people walking around?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你以前用过枪没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey hey. Ever fire one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要出去的话 我得拿一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I'm going out, I want one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 地狱里的人还想喝思乐冰呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and people in hell want slurpees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.03,0:07:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你过来训练吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come train tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是认真的 我可是个持证教练哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're serious, I'm a certified instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他先跟着我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now he can come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你负责做保姆看着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's yours to babysit then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.77,0:07:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 安德莉亚 T仔 我要你们俩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Andrea, T-dog, I want you guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉他不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔在高速上找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale found it on the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我们还有十一个避孕套\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we still have 11 condoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到的是十一个套套\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see 11 condoms,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到的是不堪回首的11分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see 11 minutes of my life I'm never getting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.23,0:07:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么糟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't that bad, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.77,0:07:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我都不知道我是否喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't even know if I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你在思考这件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:07:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是该考虑考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得高中时 我们在DQ里遇到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember the name of that waitress at the Dairy Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女服务员的名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we were in high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你 肖恩 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you, Shane, well enough to know that there is only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想让你开口聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}sure-fire way of engaging you in a conversation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得先…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,问你在高中和女生们的风流史\N{\fnArial\fs30}asking you about girls you did in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.07,0:08:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让你开口 逼不得已只能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'll willing to do it if that's what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maryanne.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你提过她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得很详细 简直是折磨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In excruciating detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.07,0:08:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨人 去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excruciating, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前就靠这些细节活着呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to live for those details back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那是近墨者黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was impressionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:08:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我一直身临其境地活在你的世界里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I may have been living vicariously through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.16,0:09:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受着我那充满难忘成就的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my impressive list of accomplishments?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时青春年少 精力旺盛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was an artist in his prime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孜孜学子 - 你是想说奇才吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A protege. - You mean prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.77,0:09:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把定期和三十岁的女人做爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is prodigy what you call a young high school stud.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,性感高中小男孩定义为「奇才」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that bangs 30-year-olds on the regular?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在高中上了哪个三十岁的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What 30-year-old were you banging in high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.19,0:09:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 体育老师 - 是丹尼尔斯先生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The P.E. Teacher. - Mr. Daniels?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是凯莉夫人好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.57,0:09:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,女子排球的教练 她不是结过婚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girls volleyball coach? Wan't she married?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜我刚刚想到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I just remembered?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我从没问过你这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I never ask you about this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.23,0:09:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不说说你的高中恋爱史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we talk about your high school love life then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么事好说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a short conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.73,0:09:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许已经说完了 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It may even already be over. - That right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.97,0:09:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个叫霍莉的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was Holly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 那也是我搞的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, that was me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个叫希拉的 她的事你对我撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there was Sheila. That's the one you lied to me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没骗你有关希拉的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never lied about sheila.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是把「满垒」的意思理解错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got mixed up about what the bases meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所知 「全垒打」通常是指性行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, a home run, that usually means a sexual act.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是性交 - 我现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's intercourse. - Yeah, I realize that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think what you did was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像二垒打之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}more like a ground rule double or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.24,0:10:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在知道裁定规则了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware of the judge's ruling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该谈这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't be talking about this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.87,0:10:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经的生活 曾经的人 都不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That life, it's gone and everyone in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.27,0:10:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheila.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽安娜 凯莉夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maryanne. Mrs. Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像我们已经老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like we're old folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.01,0:10:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们故事中的所有主人公都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the people in our stories are all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就这样忘了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just forget them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不深掘过去 还得忘记所发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard enough accepting what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without digging up the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你是什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是怀旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nostalgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像嗑药\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.69,0:10:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直不让你看清真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps you from seeing things the way they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意很危险 还有很多人依赖着你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a danger. You got people depending on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.82,0:10:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道这些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I don't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.14,0:10:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.27,0:10:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你安排每个能派上用场的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got every able body at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻遍树林找一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}out scourging these woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我心知肚明可能死了的小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a little girl we both know is likely dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们该停止搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we should abandon the search?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事轮不到我来决定 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my call, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在征求你的意见 我在征求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking. I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下来是最重要 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就意味着要做出艰难的抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means making hard decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.43,0:11:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却有本事把我们越分越散\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've got this knack. You spread us thinner and thinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力救人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to save lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.15,0:11:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却忙着救树上的小猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're out saving cats from trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么想吗 索菲亚就好比树上的猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think Sophia is, a cat in a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样伙计 别歪曲我的本意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that, man. Don't twist my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少次我们被召集起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times we get called up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找失踪的孩子 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to look for a missing child, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.35,0:11:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有黄金七十二小时 七十二小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got 72 hours. 72 hours, and after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那以后我们就是在找尸体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking for a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连这都是很久以前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真指望我们找到索菲亚的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean you honestly think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还好好地活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're just gonna find sophia alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.66,0:11:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定不会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you that sure we won't?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要听实话是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We being completely honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.57,0:11:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正指望你实话实说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm counting on you to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是数学问题 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's math, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你喜不喜欢 索菲亚只有在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love or not, Sophia, she only matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不拖累其他人的情况下才值得一救\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the degree in which she don't drag the rest of us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你想听实话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you wanted honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果当时我们继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we'd just moved on, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在已经在去贝宁堡的路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd be halfway to Fort Benning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.99,0:11:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔更不会受枪伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}right now and Carl wouldn't have gotten shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己也这么说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said so yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们还在野外寻找 冒着生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're out here, we're risking lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:11:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的亲生儿子差点因此送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own son almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥蒂斯付出了生命的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis, he paid that bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里到底是为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are we still doing this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时牵着她 肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had her in my hand, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.65,0:12:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她注视着我的双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looked in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,信任我 我却让她失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And trusted me. I failed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.18,0:12:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是这样 她根本不会逃亡在外\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't, she wouldn't be out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信她还活着 我不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she's still alive and I'm not…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会放弃她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna write her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是安德莉亚和T仔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Andrea and T-dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子我们晃悠到他们的地盘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we wandered into their grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.54,0:14:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,悠着点 悠着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Easy easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,管好你自己的事 格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind your own business, Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉任何人 求你了好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't tell anybody, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't told him yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.95,0:18:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和肖恩谈了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a long talk with Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.85,0:18:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望停止搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to call off the search.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.83,0:18:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果出事的是卡尔怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it was Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.91,0:18:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望我们继续找他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you want us to keep looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是卡尔 不论如何我都想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was Carl, yes I'd want to know one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩说我的好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane says my good intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.59,0:18:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,会削弱我们的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}are making us weaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说我不能替队伍做出\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I can't make the hard decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有利却艰难的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the good of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.93,0:18:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个决定不艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all hard decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.28,0:18:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可能开始觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe I'm holding on to a way of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没有什么意义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that doesn't make sense anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说这是数学题 最要紧的是活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says it's math, basic survival…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多少燃料 多少食物 多少弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much fuel, how much food, how much ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.65,0:18:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那等式里容不下丁点软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much room in that equation for being soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:18:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你这样看待生活的时候就容易多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty simple when you start thinking of life like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.99,0:19:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.73,0:19:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谁都没有准备好过这种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us were prepared to be living life this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用已掌握的信息做了你能做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are making the best decisions you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,最棒的决定 你一点都不软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the information you have. I don't see soft in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.13,0:19:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰姆斯先生 我爸爸想和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Grimes. My dad wants to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.63,0:19:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爬过一半了 别跟个娘们似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done half. Stop being such a pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.97,0:20:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们少了一匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of my horses is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人动过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did one of your people take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.99,0:20:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was given the impression you knew about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.15,0:20:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和达里尔谈谈这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have a word with Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.09,0:20:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天带了他出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took him out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.23,0:20:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也让你以为我同意了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he also give you the impression of my consent?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.88,0:20:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他直接说的 我信了他的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he said it outright. I took the boy at his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米只有17岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy is 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.37,0:20:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他不是我家人 但我一样要负责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not my kin but I am responsible for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.71,0:20:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些事情都要先征得我的同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things need to be cleared with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们得好好沟通一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like we need to work on our communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.52,0:20:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.44,0:20:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我管我的人 你管你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll control my people, you control yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不把箭拔出来 笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you pull that arrow out, dummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.97,0:21:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样就能把伤口好好包起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could bind your wound better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.69,0:21:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.81,0:21:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在午休吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taking a siesta or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天走背运 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shitty day, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要我给你拿个枕头来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like me to get your pillow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮你挠挠脚 - 去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe rub your feet? - Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你才是快死的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh-uh. You're the one screwed from the looks of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.47,0:22:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了这么多年教你成为真正的男子汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All them years I spent trying to make a man of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是结果吗 看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is what I get? Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.30,0:22:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺在泥里 像个用过的安全套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lying in the dirt like a used rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死在这的 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die out here, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.44,0:22:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为了什么 - 一个小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And for what? - A girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢了个小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}They lost a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.12,0:22:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在对小姑娘感兴趣了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got a thing for little girls now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我发现你不再找老莫尔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I noticed you ain't out looking for old Merle no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拼命地找过你 老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tried like hell to find you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.48,0:22:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才没有呢 你离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like hell you did. You split, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.15,0:22:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一有机会你就自己走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lit out first chance you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.63,0:22:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开的是你 当时你只要等下去就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lit out. All you had to do was wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.19,0:22:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回去找过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.37,0:22:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.61,0:22:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回去救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did right by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.70,0:22:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和那个把我拷在屋顶上的瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This the same Rick that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.08,0:22:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是同一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}cuffed me to the rooftop in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.49,0:22:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼我不得不砍掉自己的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forced me to cut off my own hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.56,0:22:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说的是同一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This him we're talking about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成他的小弟了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You his bitch now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.45,0:22:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是谁的小弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't nobody's bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.11,0:22:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在就是个笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a joke is what you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.24,0:22:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,任这些娘娘腔 黑鬼和民主党人\N{\fnArial\fs30}playing errand boy to a bunch of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.64,0:23:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,差遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}pansy-asses, niggers and democrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.46,0:23:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他们来说 你就是个怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing but a freak to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.51,0:23:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,乡巴佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redneck trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.86,0:23:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.01,0:23:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在背后取笑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're laughing at you behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.66,0:23:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a little news for you, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.44,0:23:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 他们会把你蹬开\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day they gonna scrape you off their heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.31,0:23:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像你是一坨狗屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you was dogshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.03,0:23:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.39,0:23:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是你的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ain't your kin,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,流着不一样的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.07,0:23:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是有点脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you had any damn nuts in that sack of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就应该回去冲着瑞克来一箭 给我报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd got back there and shoot your pal Rick in the face for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.97,0:23:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.34,0:23:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我 没人会在乎你 小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't nobody ever gonna care about you except me, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.78,0:23:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody ever will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.67,0:23:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get up on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.27,0:23:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别等着我把你牙踢掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I have to kick your teeth in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.34,0:25:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个王八蛋说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.10,0:26:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可别成为鸟的腹中餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't feed the birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.85,0:26:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 小达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Darylina?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这点本事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That all you got in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.94,0:26:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把包扔掉 赶紧爬上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw away that purse and climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.61,0:26:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在的时候我感觉比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked it better when you was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.25,0:27:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.46,0:27:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.70,0:27:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 从什么时候开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.56,0:27:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你生出来开始 小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, since the day you were born, baby brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.78,0:27:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你没什么用 但总得有人照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody had to look after your worthless ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.14,0:27:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来没有照顾过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never took care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的很好听 但从来没真做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk a big game but you was never there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.99,0:27:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在也一样不在 这些年来一直这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you ain't here now. Guess some things never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.63,0:27:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll tell you what…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.34,0:27:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你的吸血怪兽一样真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm as real as your chupacabra.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.43,0:27:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚我看见了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.12,0:27:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信这和你吃的毒蘑菇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure them shrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.66,0:27:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么关系 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you ate had nothing to do with it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.28,0:27:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd best shut the hell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.60,0:27:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.63,0:27:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会上来帮我闭上嘴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna come up here and shut my mouth for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.04,0:27:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那快来做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on and do it then,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.19,0:27:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你够男人的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you think you're man enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.80,0:27:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把你的高跟鞋踢掉 爬上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kick off them damn high heels and climb, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.79,0:27:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.36,0:27:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.88,0:27:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会停下来想想自己怎么会落到这般田地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd take a pause for the cause, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.21,0:27:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我觉得你爬不上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I just don't think you're gonna make it to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.04,0:27:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来呀 快来 小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.97,0:27:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你朋友瑞克的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your friend Rick's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.49,0:28:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好跑得远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you'd better run.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.16,0:28:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我从没想过我见到土豆会这么高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah? I never thought I'd be so happy to see a potato.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.34,0:28:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just glad we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.94,0:28:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用用火堆烤松鼠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}roasting squirrels over a fire in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.04,0:28:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 帕特里夏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, patricia,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.42,0:28:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢你让我们进屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}so much for letting us into your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.49,0:28:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.31,0:28:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉和卡萝尔今晚为我们做晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori and Carol are cooking dinner for us all tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.28,0:28:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人告诉我这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the first I've heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.77,0:28:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这没什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think it was that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.07,0:28:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要对我们的帮助表示感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want to thank us for helping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.54,0:28:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该和这些人划清界限\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to be setting clear boundaries with these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.12,0:28:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们过得有点太舒服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting a little too comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.13,0:28:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一顿晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.40,0:29:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和那个亚裔男孩怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with you and the Asian boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.38,0:29:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫格伦 我们是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn. He's a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.51,0:29:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更希望他和你没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.41,0:29:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要管着贝丝和吉米就已经够糟糕的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad enough I have to chase Beth and Jimmy around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.02,0:29:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用管着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you don't have to chase me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.07,0:29:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是16岁的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.35,0:29:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.40,0:29:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我指望你能成熟点呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm counting on you to be the mature one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.37,0:29:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚我的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.76,0:29:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要让事情变得比原本更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't make things harder than they need to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.73,0:29:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经长大了 你不用和我说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little old for us to be having this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.11,0:29:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要和他们走得太近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get close to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.75,0:29:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会永远待下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not going to be around forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.99,0:29:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位神枪手没事做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the Annie Oakley routine?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再去洗衣服了 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to wash clothes anymore, Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.38,0:29:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮忙放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to help keep the camp safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.59,0:29:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all right with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.25,0:30:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我只是来还你的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Just returning your book.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.14,0:30:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.72,0:30:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道这是世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had known the world was ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.79,0:30:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会带些更好看的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have brought better books.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.34,0:30:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔 你说安德莉亚是不是到生理期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, you think andrea's on her period?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.93,0:30:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么问是因为好像所有女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only asking 'cause it's like all the women.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.28,0:30:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,都举止怪异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are acting really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.21,0:30:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里看到过说女人如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I read somewhere that when women.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.91,0:30:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,常常在一起 她们生理期会同步\N{\fnArial\fs30}spend a lot of time together, their cycles line up,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.60,0:30:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就同时荷尔蒙大爆发\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they all get super crazy hormonal at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.63,0:30:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna advise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.27,0:30:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这套理论自己知道就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep that theory to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.93,0:30:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 还有谁行为怪异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Who else is acting weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:31:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛姬 - 啊 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie. - Ah, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.73,0:31:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一开始对我很刻薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}She started off being mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.20,0:31:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来她想跟我嘿咻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she wanted to have sex with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.02,0:31:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又变得很刻薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now she's being mean to me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.93,0:31:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于洛莉我都懒得问她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't even want to know what's going on with Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.00,0:31:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.73,0:31:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.05,0:31:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 回到刚才那一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's take this back a step.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.51,0:31:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道玛姬想和你嘿咻\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that Maggie wanted to have sex with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.96,0:31:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子 你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, son, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.30,0:31:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没想过她父亲会有什么反应吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it ever occur to you how her father might feel about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.11,0:31:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都22岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's 22.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.94,0:31:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他是这里的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he is our host.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.91,0:31:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.84,0:31:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 看他会不会一直蒙在鼓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, see that it stays that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.53,0:31:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 格伦 你脑子秀逗了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Glenn, what were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.09,0:31:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.66,0:31:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能明天我就挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I might be dead tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.09,0:32:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢借书给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.40,0:32:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 这书超难看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, it sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.51,0:32:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸 行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker. Walker!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.76,0:32:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.60,0:32:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌我可以从这里干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet I can nail it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.03,0:32:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 安德莉亚 把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no, Andrea. Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.36,0:32:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好让我们处理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd best let us handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.87,0:32:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩 等等 让赫谢尔处理行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, hold up. Hershel wants to deal with walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.68,0:32:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 老兄 我们能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for, man? We got it covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.66,0:33:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安德莉亚 不要 - 边儿去 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andrea, don't. - Back off, Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.93,0:33:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是达里尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.80,0:33:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你第三次拿枪指着我的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the third time you've pointed that thing at my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.75,0:33:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要开枪吗还是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna pull the trigger or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.83,0:33:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.75,0:33:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.32,0:34:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth's going on out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.45,0:34:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是开玩笑呢 - 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was kidding. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.37,0:34:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.06,0:34:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god, is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.35,0:34:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他昏过去了 子弹只是擦伤了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unconscious. You just grazed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.10,0:34:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你看他 他到底发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But look at him. What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.52,0:34:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他戴着耳朵项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's wearing ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.78,0:34:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们看到就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep that to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.55,0:34:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们 这不是索菲亚的娃娃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, isn't this Sophia's?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.42,0:34:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在河床那里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it washed up on the creek bed right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.64,0:34:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定是过河的时候弄掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must have dropped it crossing there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.74,0:34:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她差不多走了那片地儿的一半路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuts the grid almost in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.70,0:34:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用客气 - 他伤得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, you're welcome. - How's he looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.08,0:34:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到抗生素会用得那么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea we'd be going through the antibiotics so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.22,0:34:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的马去哪里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea what happened to my horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.38,0:34:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说那匹差点要了我老命的马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the one who almost killed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.61,0:35:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要是有能耐 早另觅高枝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's smart, it left the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.33,0:35:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫它奈利 就是胆小鬼奈利的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call that one Nelly, as in nervous Nelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.63,0:35:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你事先问我 我会告知你它会把你甩下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have told you she'd throw you if you'd bothered to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.19,0:35:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这样莽撞还能活着真是奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a wonder you people have survived this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.45,0:35:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.41,0:35:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然很难开口 但这次我同意赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to say it, but I'm with hershel on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.71,0:35:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再这样出去了 特别是这次以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't keep going out there, not after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.32,0:35:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在就想放弃？达里尔才冒着生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd quit now? Daryl just risked his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.73,0:35:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,带回来第一个确凿证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring back the first hard evidence we've had.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.93,0:35:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这么看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is one way to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.01,0:35:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 达里尔今天为个娃娃差点送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I see it, daryl almost died today for a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.79,0:35:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 我就知道你这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know how you see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.03,0:35:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是冷酷无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not out to be a hard case.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.36,0:35:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想现实一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just being realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.60,0:35:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得开始做这种艰难的抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just got to start making the tough calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.63,0:35:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.90,0:35:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许并不赞同他所有做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not agree with all of his choices,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.82,0:35:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我尊重他的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I respect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.54,0:36:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你和我的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know yours and mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.51,0:36:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的选择并没那么难\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your way isn't harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.77,0:36:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最容易的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the easiest thing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.68,0:36:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是撒手不去管别人死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}to cut our losses and to not help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.77,0:36:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直告诉自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep telling yourself you're.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.12,0:36:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在做艰难的抉择 其实你是想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}making the tough calls. You're really just trying…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.70,0:36:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这世上我唯一关心的就是你和卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I care about now in this world is you and carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.50,0:36:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果觉得我对别人视若无睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I apologize if I appear to be insensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.41,0:36:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我道歉 但是你也看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the needs of others, but you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.78,0:36:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你俩的安全我愿意做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do whatever it takes to keep the two of you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.22,0:36:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是放弃一个迷路的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even abandoning a lost child?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.41,0:36:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.89,0:36:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我儿子不再是你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son and I are not your problem anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.94,0:36:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者借口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or your excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.24,0:36:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么样了 - 他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's he doing? - He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.96,0:36:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.65,0:36:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向达里尔开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.34,0:37:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太苛责自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be too hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.03,0:37:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都曾想向达里尔开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all wanted to shoot Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.10,0:37:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.74,0:37:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚餐准备好了 你来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner's ready. You coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.97,0:37:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要帮助吗 - 不用 我马上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need anything? - Huh-uh, I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.55,0:38:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会弹吉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anybody know how to play guitar?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.08,0:38:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔找到把不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale found a cool one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.46,0:38:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有人会弹吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's got to know how to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.70,0:38:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥蒂斯会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.53,0:38:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他还弹得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and he was very good too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.30,0:39:07.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（今晚 哪里见）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.10,0:39:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.61,0:39:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是看起来的这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As good as I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.24,0:39:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了晚餐给你 你一定饿坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you some dinner. You must be starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.66,0:39:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 我缝了针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out, I got stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.26,0:39:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.59,0:40:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天为我女儿做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did more for my little girl today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.48,0:40:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,比她父亲一生做的事都多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than her own daddy ever did in his whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.14,0:40:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,换了瑞克和肖恩也会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do anything Rick or Shane wouldn't have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.79,0:40:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.85,0:40:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和他们都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're every bit as good as them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.17,0:40:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.30,0:40:45.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（有试过在草棚里做吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.71,0:42:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该看到这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't supposed to see this.
